 947:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_DelSig.c **** *
 948:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_DelSig.c **** * Summary:
 949:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_DelSig.c **** *  Converts the ADC counts output to mVolts as a 16-bit integer. For
 950:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_DelSig.c **** *  example, if the ADC measured 0.534 volts, the return value would
 951:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_DelSig.c **** *  be 534 mVolts.
